{"css":".fx-sbb{width:min(560px,100%);position:relative}\n.fx-sbb .box{height:min(70vh,440px);overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface);position:relative}\n.fx-sbb .bar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1em;padding:.7em 1em;background:var(--primary);color:var(--on-primary);transform:translateY(-110%);margin-bottom:-3.2em;transition:transform calc(.35s/var(--speed)) cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);height:3.2em}\n.fx-sbb .bar.on{transform:none}\n.fx-sbb .bar b{flex:1;font-size:.95em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.fx-sbb .bar button{background:var(--accent);color:var(--on-accent);border:0;border-radius:99px;padding:.5em 1.1em;font:700 .85em var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}\n.fx-sbb .in{padding:1.2em}.fx-sbb .in .fx-art{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:calc(var(--radius)*.7);margin-bottom:1em}\n.fx-sbb .main{width:100%;background:var(--primary);color:var(--on-primary);border:0;border-radius:99px;padding:.9em;font:700 1em var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;margin:.8em 0 1.4em}\n.fx-sbb p+p{margin-top:.8em;opacity:.75}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.fx-sbb .bar{transition:none}}","html":"<div class=\"fx fx-sbb\"><div class=\"box\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Product page preview\"><div class=\"bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b>Halden Sofa · RM 4,890</b><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\">Add to cart</button></div><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"fx-art\"></div><h3>Halden Sofa</h3><p style=\"font-size:1.4em;font-weight:700;margin:.2em 0\">RM 4,890</p><button class=\"main\" type=\"button\">Add to cart</button><p>Scroll down inside this box — once the button above leaves the view, the bar pins to the top.</p><p>Solid oak frame, removable covers, 10-year frame warranty. Delivered and assembled.</p><p>Dimensions W 218 × D 94 × H 82 cm. Seat height 44 cm. Weight 58 kg.</p><p>Care: vacuum weekly, spot-clean with mild soap, re-oil the frame once a year.</p><p>Returns: 14 days for standard sizes. Custom sizes are final.</p><p>Delivery: 3–4 weeks. We call to arrange a delivery window.</p></div></div></div>","js":"(function(){var r=document.querySelector('.fx-sbb'),box=r.querySelector('.box'),bar=r.querySelector('.bar'),m=r.querySelector('.main');\nif(!('IntersectionObserver' in window))return;\nnew IntersectionObserver(function(e){bar.classList.toggle('on',!e[0].isIntersecting&&e[0].boundingClientRect.top<0)},{root:box,threshold:0}).observe(m)})();"}